  "title": "Rhubarb Hot Dish",
  "description": "This rhubarb hot dish recipe features fresh chopped rhubarb baked in a sweet, creamy egg custard made with heavy cream and milk, flavored with cinnamon.",
  "authors": [
    "Katrina Strilcov Hetletvedt"
  ],
